        <content>
          <p>Transparent centrifugal pump. Each vector lists the settings 100%, 90%, 80%, 70%, 60%, 50%, 40%, 30%, 20%, and 0% (valve closed) of the maximum flowrate. The intake gauge reads in inches of mercury (negative = vacuum); the discharge gauge reads in psi.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
