        <content>
          <p>Centrifugal pump power and efficiency. Since ṁ·e = ρQ·ΔP/ρ = Q·ΔP, the density cancels and η = QΔP/(IV): ∂η/∂Q = ΔP/Ẇ, ∂η/∂P_discharge = Q/Ẇ, ∂η/∂P_intake = -Q/Ẇ, ∂η/∂Ẇ = -η/Ẇ</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="5100" width="640" height="45" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
